# ==============================================================================
# Sonora — Secure YouTube API Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Never commit the real .env file or expose the API key in client-side code.
# The YouTube Data API key is consumed exclusively by Sonora's server-side proxy.
#
# To obtain a YouTube Data API v3 key:
# 1. Visit Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/)
# 2. Create a project (or select an existing one)
# 3. Enable the "YouTube Data API v3" under APIs & Services > Library
# 4. Create an API Key under APIs & Services > Credentials
# 5. Paste the key below into your local .env file (copy this file to .env)
# ==============================================================================

YOUTUBE_API_KEY=your_youtube_data_api_v3_key_here
PORT=5173
